==Trivia==
With 190 {{TCG|HP}}, Venusaur ex currently has the highest base HP of any card in Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket; with the {{TCG ID|Celestial Guardians|Leaf Cape|147}} {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} attached, it can reach 220 HP, which is currently the highest attainable HP in the game.

===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Venusaur}}.
*{{m|Razor Leaf}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Venusaur}} can learn.
*'''Giant Bloom''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Venusaur|20}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.

